@startuml

title Add/Edit user - Sequence Diagram 

actor "User" as admin
participant "User Management Service" as ums
participant "Database" as db

' scenario: Admin adds or edits a user '
admin -> ums: Request to add/edit user
ums -> db: Validate user data
db --> ums: Validation result
alt Validation successful
    ums -> db: Save user data
    db --> ums: Confirmation of save
    ums --> admin: User added/edited successfully
else Validation failed
    ums --> admin: Error message with validation issues
end

' scenario: Admin cancels the operation '
admin -> ums: Cancel add/edit user operation
ums --> admin: Operation cancelled confirmation

' scenario: Admin requests user details for editing ' 
admin -> ums: Request user details for editing
ums -> db: Fetch user details
db --> ums: User details
ums --> admin: Display user details for editing


@enduml